<p>Results that the automated checks cannot decide go to a person for review. They are counted neither as failures nor as passes.</p>
<p class="meta">Checks used: axe-core 4.14.0.</p>
<h2>If you are not satisfied with our response</h2>
<p>If our reply does not resolve the problem, you can contact the consumer authority in your country.</p>
<p>More information: <a href="https://consumer-authority.example/accessibility">https://consumer-authority.example/accessibility</a></p>
<p class="meta">This statement was prepared on October 17, 2026. It was last reviewed on October 18, 2026.</p>
